Test this program using: "go test"

This program allows you to quickly scan ports. I added documentation,
switched to DialTimeout instead of Dial to speed things up, added the 
tracking of closed ports, both in displaying them and returning them and I
checked the ports buffer to balance memory usage and speed.

I created options for the user to specify what address they want to scan,
which port range they are interested in (with error checking), a timeout 
adjustment option, and the ability to hide the closed ports for a more 
readable output.

I also updated the testing functionality to accomodate these new features and
my additions.
